## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear provides audio visual rental for a single exhibitor's own stand at a trade show or feria in Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol: a screen or projector for a product demo, sound sized to the stand's own footprint, a wireless microphone for a presenter, and ambient RGBW lighting, matched to a real package. LED video walls, touchscreens and kiosks are not in our own inventory, our own crew does not design or fabricate booths or rig screens and signage overhead, and there is no standard published multi day rate, all covered plainly below rather than blurred into vague "full service" language. If your stand needs something from that list, tell us: we can find out whether one of our suppliers could handle it, if any can.

## Key Highlights

---

-   AV for your own stand's demo or presentation, sized from a small footprint up to a staffed 120 guest capacity stand.
-   No LED video wall and zero rigging or truss stock, confirmed against our own inventory, and no booth design or building by our own crew.
-   Our 5000 lumen projector stays legible with the hall's own lights on, built for a lit exhibition floor rather than a darkened screening room.
-   No standard multi day trade show rate is published. We operate delivery only, single event pricing, and a multi day booking is a custom quote, not an invented day rate.
-   RGBW ambient lighting comes standard on the Eco Pack and can be discussed as an addition on a larger package. See [Ambient Lighting for the Stand](#ambient-lighting-for-the-stand) below.

## What We Provide for Your Own Stand

<InlineCTA />

An exhibitor's own stand at a trade show is a small, self contained footprint inside a much larger hall, not the hall itself, and that difference is the whole basis of what we offer. For a product demo or reel, a screen or projector reads clearly even with the hall's overhead lights on. For a presenter doing periodic pitches to passing visitors, a wireless handheld microphone lets them step away from the stand and move with the crowd rather than staying fixed behind a table. For the stand's own presentation area, 2 active speakers sized to that footprint carry the demo audio to the people actually standing at your stand, not the whole aisle. Ambient RGBW lighting rounds out the atmosphere around the demo area itself.

That is the honest scope: AV for your own stand's demo or presentation, not a booth AV production company. If your event is a full multi vendor exhibition build with a design brief, a general contractor and a booth construction crew, the section below is worth reading before you get in touch.

## The Honest Line: What We Don't Stock for a Trade Show Booth

Being direct about scope here matters more than on most pages we publish, because real trade show AV search intent is dominated by exhibit house content our own inventory and crew do not cover at that scale. Here is what sits outside them:

-   **LED video walls or custom booth fabrication and design.** Our large format display is a single premium 60 inch high definition LED screen with a designer stand, not a modular tiled video wall, and our own crew does not design, build or fabricate a booth structure.
-   **Rigging or truss for suspended screens or signage.** Our own crew does not build truss or fly a screen, banner or signage overhead. See our [audio visual rental safety guidelines](/blog/audio-visual-rental-safety-guidelines/) for how we place equipment. A screen goes on its own stand or, as at ECOC 2026 below, onto the stand's own wall.
-   **Touchscreens, kiosks or registration desk laptops.** None of them is in our own inventory, so we give no model or spec sheet for them.
-   **A standard published multi day trade show rate.** We operate delivery only, priced per single event, not per day. There is no catalog day rate for a multi day booth booking. That said, multi day is not impossible: our crew ran the full display and sound production across the four day [PROGOLD SUMMIT 2026 in Torremolinos](/blog/news-malaga-event-gear-delivers-flawless-audiovisual-production-at-progold-summit-2026-in-torremolinos/), a genuine multi day engagement quoted and staffed individually, not sold off a published rate card. A multi day stand works the same way: [contact us](/contact/) for a custom quote rather than expect a per day price on this page.

For the first three, describe what your stand needs and we can see if a supplier is able to cover it. If none is, you will hear it from us at the quote stage. A suspended screen or banner would be rigged by a specialised supplier, if we can find one, never by our own crew.

## A Lit Room Legible Screen for Your Product Demo

An exhibition hall almost never goes dark for one stand's demo, which is exactly the problem a standard conference projector has: it is built for a dim room, and it washes out the moment the hall's own lighting stays on so the rest of the floor can keep moving. Our Product Presentation Pack's projector is rated at 5000 lumens specifically to stay legible in a lit room, the same condition every trade show floor runs under, and it pairs with a wireless handheld microphone so a presenter can step toward a passing visitor without pausing the demo rather than staying tethered to a lectern.

We cover the flat panel screen on its own, and where it fits a busy exhibition floor, in more depth in our TV screen rental guide, which already names exhibition booth branding as one of its use cases. This page covers the fuller stand scenario that guide does not: sound, a microphone and lighting matched to a package alongside the screen, not the screen in isolation.

## Sound Sized to Your Stand, Not the Whole Hall

Being honest about scale matters here too. Our active speaker pairs are sized to a stand's own presentation footprint, the people actually standing in front of your demo, not to outcompete the ambient noise of a full exhibition hall or the neighboring stands around you. If your goal is filling a plenary hall or a large congress room with sound, that is a different job, closer to what our MICE Pack handles for a congress stage, not a single stand's demo audio.

For a stand, that sizing works in your favor: 2 active speakers pointed at your own footprint carry a presenter's voice and demo audio clearly to visitors standing there, without you paying for, or needing, a system built to fill the whole floor.

## Ambient Lighting for the Stand

Our Eco Pack includes 2 RGBW LED light bars as a standard inclusion, exactly the kind of ambient wash that gives a small stand some visual presence beyond bare aisle lighting. On the packages built around a demo screen and microphone, the Product Presentation Pack, Basic MICE Pack and MICE Pack, ambient lighting is not a standard line item, and we will not claim otherwise here. It can be discussed as an addition when you book, the same honest approach we take with lighting extras on our other event pages, rather than bundled in as if every package already includes it.

