## One Stand, Not an Exhibit House

Everything above is for a single exhibitor's own stand, delivered, installed, tested and collected around your show dates. Our own crew does not design or fabricate booths or rig truss, and we do not run a full multi vendor floor build. If your trade show needs a general contractor, a design brief and a booth construction crew, most plausibly for a large floor at [FYCMA](https://www.fycma.com/), Malaga's main trade show and congress venue, that is the work of an exhibit house rather than a per event rental company like us, and worth confirming honestly at the quote stage rather than assuming either way.

## Booking and Service Area

Our services cover Malaga, the Costa del Sol and Sevilla with no minimum order, and extend to Granada for rentals over 400 euros. Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability, and see our [audio visual rental planning timeline](/blog/audio-visual-rental-planning-timeline/) guide for what we actually need from you to quote a stand booking accurately. If your show runs across several days at a venue like FYCMA or in Torremolinos, tell us that upfront so we can scope it as the custom, multi day quote it actually is, not a package priced for a single day.

## Conclusion

An honest audio visual rental for a trade show stand in Malaga is AV for your own stand's demo, not a booth production company: a lit room legible screen or projector, sound sized to your footprint, a wireless microphone for a presenter, and ambient lighting, matched to a real package. LED video walls, touchscreens and kiosks are not in our own inventory, our own crew does not design booths or rig truss, and there is no standard multi day rate. [Contact us](/contact/) with your stand size and what you want to show, and for our full equipment range, see the [audio visual rental in Malaga](/blog/audio-visual-rental/) guide.

## FAQs

### Do you provide LED video walls for a trade show booth?

Not from our own inventory. Our large format display is a single premium 60 inch high definition LED screen with a designer stand, not a modular tiled LED video wall. See [The Honest Line](#the-honest-line-what-we-dont-stock-for-a-trade-show-booth) above.

### Do you design or build exhibition booths and stands?

Not with our own crew. Booth design, fabrication and construction are not work our own team does. We supply the AV, screen, sound, microphone and lighting, for a stand you or a booth builder have already set up. See [The Honest Line](#the-honest-line-what-we-dont-stock-for-a-trade-show-booth) above.

### Can you rig or suspend a screen or signage above our stand?

Not with our own crew. We carry zero rigging or truss stock, confirmed against our own inventory, and our own crew does not build truss or fly a screen or signage overhead. See [The Honest Line](#the-honest-line-what-we-dont-stock-for-a-trade-show-booth) above, and our [audio visual rental safety guidelines](/blog/audio-visual-rental-safety-guidelines/) for the full honest picture on this.

### Do you rent touchscreens, kiosks or laptops for a registration desk?

Not from our own inventory. Touchscreens, kiosks and registration desk laptops are not part of it, so we publish no spec sheet or price for them. See [The Honest Line](#the-honest-line-what-we-dont-stock-for-a-trade-show-booth) above.

### What is your day rate for a multi day trade show?

We do not publish one. We operate delivery only, priced per single event, not per day. Multi day work is possible, as it was for the four day [PROGOLD SUMMIT 2026 in Torremolinos](/blog/news-malaga-event-gear-delivers-flawless-audiovisual-production-at-progold-summit-2026-in-torremolinos/), but it is quoted individually rather than sold off a standard rate card. [Contact us](/contact/) for a custom quote. See [The Honest Line](#the-honest-line-what-we-dont-stock-for-a-trade-show-booth) above.

### What AV equipment do I actually get for my stand?

A screen or projector for a product demo, sound sized to your stand's own footprint, a wireless handheld microphone for a presenter, and, on the Eco Pack, ambient RGBW lighting. See [What We Provide for Your Own Stand](#what-we-provide-for-your-own-stand) above.

### Will your sound system compete with the noise of a busy exhibition hall?

No, and it is not built to. Our speaker pairs are sized to your stand's own footprint, not to outproject a neighboring stand or fill a whole hall. See [Sound Sized to Your Stand, Not the Whole Hall](#sound-sized-to-your-stand-not-the-whole-hall) above.

### Which package fits a product demo at our stand?

Most often the [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/), which bundles the lit room legible 5000 lumen projector with a wireless handheld microphone and sound. A larger, staffed stand fits the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/) or [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) instead. See [Match Your Stand to a Package](#match-your-stand-to-a-package) above.

### Is a technician available for the full show day, or just part of it?

The [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/) includes a technician for up to 6 continuous hours. For a full show day, the [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/)'s optional dedicated on site technician add on, at 240 euros per day, is the closer fit. The [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/) and [Product Presentation Pack](/packages/product-presentation/) are self run after our crew installs and tests the system.

### How far in advance should we book for a trade show?

Book at least 24 hours in advance to guarantee availability, and earlier once your show dates and stand size are confirmed, particularly if the show runs multiple days or needs a custom quote. See our [audio visual rental planning timeline](/blog/audio-visual-rental-planning-timeline/) guide for the full process.
